        "body": "FUFA published the first-round fixtures for the 2026/27 FUFA Big League on 15 September 2026. The season kicks off on Sunday 27 September 2026 and the first round runs to 20 December 2026. CATDA open at home to Rwenzori Lions FC at Hamz Stadium-Nakivubo, then travel to SC Volcanoes in round two. Matchday details will follow here as the club confirms them.",
